#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:5
msgid "Chat Completions"
msgstr "Chat Completions（对话补全）"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:7
msgid ""
"This guide covers multi-modal chat through AIBrix's gateway: ``POST "
"/v1/chat/completions`` with a prompt that mixes text and media, answered "
"by an omni model. The gateway handles it like any other chat completion, "
"including routing, streaming and token usage as described in :doc"
":`gateway-plugins`, and forwards fields it does not know unchanged. ``GET"
" /v1/models`` lists the models AIBrix serves, and ``POST "
"/v1/chat/completions/batch`` answers several conversations in one call, "
"as :ref:`below <omni-chat-batch>`; see the :ref:`supported endpoints "
"<multimodal-supported-endpoints>`. Before you start, finish the"
" :ref:`prerequisites <omni-prerequisites>` and :ref:`gateway access "
"<omni-access-gateway>` steps on the Multi-Modal Serving page, and deploy "
"your model the way the :ref:`video guide <omni-video-deploy>` describes, "
"swapping in an omni chat model."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍通过 AIBrix 网关进行多模态对话： ``POST /v1/chat/completions`` 请求中的提示词混合了文本和媒体，由"
" omni 模型作答。网关像处理其他 chat completion 一样处理它，包括 :doc:`gateway-plugins` "
"中介绍的路由、流式输出和 token 用量，并将自己不认识的字段原样转发。 ``GET /v1/models`` 列出 AIBrix "
"提供服务的模型， ``POST /v1/chat/completions/batch`` 可在一次调用中回答多个会话，详见 :ref:`下文 "
"<omni-chat-batch>` ；参见 :ref:`支持的端点 <multimodal-supported-endpoints>` 。开始之前，请先完成多模态服务页面上的 :ref:`前置条件 <omni-"
"prerequisites>` 和 :ref:`访问网关 <omni-access-gateway>` 步骤，并按照 :ref:`视频指南 "
"<omni-video-deploy>` 所述方式部署模型，换成 omni 对话模型。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:10
msgid ""
"A text+audio example (`Qwen/Qwen2.5-Omni-7B "
"<https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-Omni-7B>`_) lives at "
"`samples/vllm_omni/qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml <https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/blob/main/samples/vllm_omni/qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml>`_ in the"
" AIBrix repository."
msgstr ""
"文本 + 音频示例（ `Qwen/Qwen2.5-Omni-7B <https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5"
"-Omni-7B>`_ ）位于 AIBrix 仓库的 `samples/vllm_omni/qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml "
"<https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/blob/main/samples/vllm_omni/qwen2-5-omni-7b.yaml>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:15
msgid "Ask About an Image"
msgstr "询问图像内容"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:17
msgid ""
"Send the image as an OpenAI-style content part inside ``messages``. "
"``modalities`` asks the engine for text-only output:"
msgstr "将图像作为 OpenAI 风格的内容部分放在 ``messages`` 中发送。 ``modalities`` 用于要求引擎只输出文本："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:37
msgid "What the gateway does with it:"
msgstr "网关如何处理它："

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:39
msgid ""
"Media travels inside ``messages[].content`` as content parts. The gateway"
" does not decode or validate them; the engine does."
msgstr "媒体以内容部分的形式放在 ``messages[].content`` 中传递。网关不会解码或校验它们，由引擎负责。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:40
msgid "Fields it does not inspect, such as ``modalities``, are forwarded as sent."
msgstr "网关不检查的字段，例如 ``modalities`` ，会原样转发。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:41
msgid ""
"The gateway writes array-form message content, including inline base64 "
"media, into the text it uses for prefix-cache-aware routing. Prefer a URL"
" over a base64 data URL to keep that text small."
msgstr ""
"网关会把数组形式的消息内容（包括内联的 base64 媒体）写入前缀缓存感知路由所使用的文本中。请优先使用 URL 而不是 base64 data"
" URL，以保持该文本较小。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:42
msgid ""
"The request body counts against the gateway's request size limit, 4 MiB "
"by default; see Message Size Configuration in :doc:`gateway-plugins`. A "
"URL also keeps large images under it."
msgstr ""
"请求体计入网关的请求大小上限，默认 4 MiB；参见 :doc:`gateway-plugins` 中的消息大小配置。使用 URL "
"也能让大图保持在该上限之内。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:49
msgid "Batch Chat Completions"
msgstr "批量 Chat Completions（批量对话补全）"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:51
msgid ""
"``POST /v1/chat/completions/batch`` answers several conversations in one "
"call. It is the chat completions request with one difference: "
"``messages`` is a list of conversations, each a list of messages. The "
"response is **one non-streaming JSON document**, a chat completion with "
"one choice per conversation (``choices[i]`` answers ``messages[i]``) and "
"``usage`` summed over the whole batch. vLLM-Omni serves it; SGLang-Omni "
"does not."
msgstr ""
"``POST /v1/chat/completions/batch`` 在一次调用中回答多个会话。它就是 chat completions 请求，只有一处不同： "
"``messages`` 是会话列表，每个会话本身是一个消息列表。响应是 **一个非流式 JSON 文档** ，即一个 chat completion，"
"每个会话对应一个 choice（ ``choices[i]`` 回答 ``messages[i]`` ），并且 ``usage`` "
"为整个批次的汇总值。vLLM-Omni 提供该端点，SGLang-Omni 不提供。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:70
msgid ""
"It needs no new route: the ``/v1/chat/completions`` path match already "
"covers it, and the gateway routes the whole batch to one pod of the "
"requested model, like a single chat completion."
msgstr ""
"它不需要新增路由： ``/v1/chat/completions`` 的路径匹配已经覆盖它，网关会像处理单个 chat completion "
"一样，把整个批次路由到所请求模型的某一个 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:71
msgid ""
"It checks only the envelope: a non-empty ``model`` and a non-empty "
"``messages`` list whose entries are non-empty lists of messages. A flat "
"list of messages, the single-conversation shape, is rejected with "
"``400`` naming ``messages.0``. Everything else, including message "
"contents and sampling options, is left to the engine."
msgstr ""
"它只检查外层结构：非空的 ``model``，以及非空的 ``messages`` 列表，其中每一项都是非空的消息列表。扁平的消息列表（即单会话的形态）会以"
" ``400`` 被拒绝，并指出 ``messages.0`` 。其余内容，包括消息内容和采样选项，均交由引擎处理。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:72
msgid ""
"The conversations are joined into one text for prefix-cache-aware "
"routing, and the request body is forwarded as sent."
msgstr "各个会话会被拼接成一段文本，用于前缀缓存感知路由，请求体则原样转发。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:73
msgid ""
"The gateway never treats a batch as a streaming (SSE) request, whatever "
"``stream`` says, and handles the response as one JSON document. The "
"engine does not stream a batch either and may reject ``stream: true``, so"
" send ``stream`` as ``false`` or leave it out. The engine also refuses "
"``n`` greater than 1 and beam search."
msgstr ""
"无论 ``stream`` 如何设置，网关都不会把批次请求当作流式（SSE）请求，并始终将响应作为一个 JSON 文档处理。引擎同样不会以流式返回批次，并且可能拒绝 "
"``stream: true``，因此请将 ``stream`` 设为 ``false`` 或直接省略。引擎还会拒绝大于 1 的 ``n`` 以及 beam search。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:74
msgid ""
"Token usage is read from the summed ``usage``, so a user's TPM limit is "
"charged for the whole batch."
msgstr "token 用量取自汇总后的 ``usage`` ，因此用户的 TPM 限额按整个批次计费。"

#: ../../source/features/gateway-routing/omni-chat.rst:75
msgid ""
"The ``pd`` routing strategy is not supported for this endpoint and is "
"rejected with ``400``."
msgstr "该端点不支持 ``pd`` 路由策略，使用时会以 ``400`` 被拒绝。"
